253
00:28:46,034 --> 00:28:46,975
Aku tahu itu.

254
00:28:53,711 --> 00:28:54,908
Apa?

255
00:28:54,908 --> 00:28:55,918
Tidak ada.

256
00:29:00,957 --> 00:29:02,851
