275
00:31:27,966 --> 00:31:29,302
Hai, Junebug.

276
00:31:33,444 --> 00:31:34,406
Ada apa?

277
00:31:37,215 --> 00:31:38,146
June!

278
00:31:39,580 --> 00:31:40,544
June!

279
00:31:43,553 --> 00:31:44,614
