00:44:26,841 --> 00:44:28,147
Ibu?

416
00:44:28,147 --> 00:44:29,147
Sam?

417
00:44:42,458 --> 00:44:46,165
Tidak!

418
00:44:46,165 --> 00:44:47,165
Tidak!

419
00:44:48,599 --> 00:44:49,596
Tidak! Tidak!

420
00:45:23,898 --> 00:45:24,906
