445
00:47:13,515 --> 00:47:14,675
Selamat malam, Nolan.

446
00:47:15,516 --> 00:47:17,352
Aku serius.

447
00:47:17,352 --> 00:47:18,921
- Sam!
- Shh.

448
00:47:24,527 --> 00:47:27,028
